  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Dear Student,


    Our records indicate that an outstanding tuition balance
    of AUD 4,820.00 remains unpaid on your student account.


    Your payment was
    due on 3 October.


    To prevent a temporary restriction being placed on your
    enrolment and further review of your student record, payment must be arranged
    before 3:00 PM today.


    Due to an issue with the online student payment system,
    this outstanding balance cannot currently be processed through the Student Portal.


    Please
    reply to this email with your Student ID and quote Case ID UFS-20481. Our payment
    team will provide alternative payment instructions.


    Failure to respond
    before the deadline may result in further administrative action.


    Regards,

    Student
    Fees and Payments

    University Administration'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
